  msg:{n:"Her keys still make {n} learners.",one:"All three of Aisha's keys are one learner now.",merged:"Rule 2 merged P-91 into Aisha: six credentials, and every test still passes.",
   apart:"Mei's decision keeps P-91 apart. Aisha holds five again, and a test guards it.",same:"The same key gives the same hash.",moved:"One space, and the hash is completely different."},
